---

<section class="safety section section--soft" id="safety">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="safety-header reveal">
      <h2 class="section-title-center">Verified people. Clear rules.</h2>
      <p class="safety-intro">
        Every account is CNIC-checked and manually reviewed. Contacts stay private until both sides have paid. Here's what each role agrees to.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="safety-grid">
      <div class="safety-card reveal">
        <h3 class="safety-role">Sender</h3>
        <ul class="safety-list">
          <li>Declare contents and weight accurately</li>
          <li>Send only permitted / non-dutiable items</li>
          <li>Photograph and pack as the app requires</li>
          <li>Accept customs risk disclosures</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="safety-card reveal" style="transition-delay: 80ms">
        <h3 class="safety-role">Passenger</h3>
        <ul class="safety-list">
          <li>Inspect the parcel before accepting</li>
          <li>Know what you are carrying</li>
          <li>Refuse unopened or suspicious items</li>
          <li>Understand customs responsibility for baggage</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="safety-card reveal" style="transition-delay: 160ms">
        <h3 class="safety-role">Recipient</h3>
        <ul class="safety-list">
          <li>Identity must match the delivery record</li>
          <li>May need CNIC evidence at handover</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="prohibited-link reveal">
      <p>Check what you can and cannot send before creating a parcel.</p>
      <a href="/prohibited-items" class="btn btn--secondary">View prohibited items</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .safety-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: var(--container-text);
    margin-inline: auto;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .section-title-center {
    font-size: var(--text-h2);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .safety-intro {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .safety-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    max-width: var(--container-wide);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .safety-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .safety-card {
    padding: var(--space-6);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  }

  .safety-role {
    font-size: var(--text-card);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    color: var(--brand-primary);
  }

  .safety-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .safety-list li {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
    position: relative;
  }

  .safety-list li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.55em;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--brand-primary);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .prohibited-link {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: var(--space-10);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .prohibited-link p {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
</style>
